to version two. And we'd shut off version&nbsp;
one, and then put version three in that one.

01:35:11.200 --> 01:35:14.880
So bluegreen deployments are powerful&nbsp;
and extensible deployment strategy&nbsp;&nbsp;

01:35:15.440 --> 01:35:18.240
that works well with teams that&nbsp;
are deploying a few times per day.&nbsp;&nbsp;

